.TH CIRCLE_OVERLAPS 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
circle_overlaps \- Whether two circles (centers a and b, radii ra and rb) overlap
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcollide.h\(dq
.BI "bool circle_overlaps(Vec2 a, float ra, Vec2 b, float rb);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Whether two circles (centers a and b, radii ra and rb) overlap. Better than rectangles for round things and for a "pickup radius" around a point; no square root, so it is as cheap as rect_overlaps.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if the distance between centers is less than ra + rb.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/collide.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rect_overlaps (3),
.BR v2_dist (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
